Privacy Policy for Verdant App

*Last Updated: April 2, 2026*

**O1E3 Studio** ("we," "our," or "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how your information is collected, used, and disclosed by the **Verdant** mobile application ("the App").

By downloading or using the App, you agree to this Privacy Policy. If you do not agree, please do not use the App.

#1. Information We Collect

To provide a private and fluid environment, the Verdant App is designed to minimize data collection. We collect information only when it is essential for the App’s core functionality.

## A. Data Stored Locally (On Your Device)
The core features of Verdant (focus timers, garden progression, and statistics) operate completely locally on your device. All your focus sessions, grown plants, and app settings are saved locally using SQLite and Shared Preferences. **We do not transmit, collect, or store this personal focus data on our servers.**

## B. Automatically Collected Data
When you use the App, we may collect certain information automatically through third-party services that help us provide and improve the App:

*   **In-App Purchases & Subscriptions (RevenueCat):** To manage Premium features, we use RevenueCat. RevenueCat may collect an Anonymous App User ID, your purchase history, and device identifiers (such as OS version, device model) to properly grant you access to premium features and combat fraud. We do not process or store your payment information directly (e.g., credit card numbers); this is handled securely by Google Play.
*   **Permissions:** 
    *   *Notifications & Alarms:* We request notification and exact alarm permissions to alert you when your Focus or Break sessions are complete. Notifications are scheduled locally on your device.
    *   *Vibration/Haptics:* We use device haptics to provide tactile feedback during interactions.

2. How We Use Your Information

The minimal information we or our third-party partners collect is used for the following purposes:
*   **Operating the App:** To process and manage your in-app subscriptions and unlock "Verdant Pro" features.
*   **App Functionality:** To send local push notifications when a timer finishes (no data leaves your device for this).
*   **Compliance:** To comply with legal obligations and enforce our terms.

3. Third-Party Services & Links

The App uses third-party services that may collect information used to identify you. Below are the privacy policies of the third-party service providers used by the App:

